@startuml 02-finalizeorder-internals
!theme plain
title Order::finalizeOrder() - Internal Steps Analysis

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam activityBorderColor #333333

|#E8F5E9|Order::finalizeOrder()|

start

:1. **Idempotency Check**
Check if order exists via sess_challenge;

if (Order exists?) then (yes)
    #FFCDD2:Return ORDER_STATE_ORDEREXISTS|
    stop
endif

:2. **Set Order ID**
From session sess_challenge;

if (Not recalculating?) then (yes)
    :3. **Validate Order**
    - validatePayment()
    - validateDelivery()
    - validateDeliveryAddress()
    - validateBasket();

    if (Validation failed?) then (yes)
        #FFCDD2:Return validation error state|
        stop
    endif
endif

:4. **Copy User Info**
assignUserInformation();

:5. **Copy Basket Info**
loadFromBasket();

:6. **Set Payment Info**
setPayment();

if (Not recalculating?) then (yes)
    :7. **Set Order Folder**
    setFolder() = ORDERFOLDER_NEW;
endif

:8. **Set Status**
setOrderStatus('NOT_FINISHED');

:9. **Save to Database**
save();

note right
    **DANGER ZONE**
    Order now exists in DB
    but payment not executed
end note

if (Not recalculating?) then (yes)
    |#FFF3E0|Payment Execution|
    :10. **Execute Payment**
    executePayment($oBasket, $oUserPayment);

    note right
        **STRIPE OVERRIDE**
        Stripe\Model\Order::executePayment()
        returns TRUE for osc_stripe_* payments
        (payment already processed)
    end note

    if (Payment failed?) then (yes)
        :Delete order from DB;
        #FFCDD2:Return ORDER_STATE_PAYMENTERROR|
        stop
    endif
endif

|#E3F2FD|Post-Payment Processing|

:11. **Set Order Number**
if (!oxordernr) setNumber();

:12. **Update Order Date**
(if not recalculating);

:13. **Set Status OK**
setOrderStatus('OK');

:14. **Update Basket**
setOrderId();

:15. **Update Wishlists**
updateWishlist()
updateNoticeList();

if (Not recalculating?) then (yes)
    :16. **Mark Vouchers**
    markVouchers();

    :17. **Send Emails**
    sendOrderByEmail();
endif

#C8E6C9:Return ORDER_STATE_OK or MAILINGERROR|

stop

legend right
    **Problem Analysis**

    Steps 1-9: Order Creation
    Step 10: Payment (bypassed for Stripe)
    Steps 11-17: Post-processing

    For external payment providers:
    - Payment is ALREADY done
    - Step 10 is redundant
    - But we can't skip it without override
endlegend

@enduml
